# What this engine says, case by case, for esmx.
#
# Mexican Spanish is not IBM's and there is nothing to hold it
# to: these are what this engine does,not what any original
# did. They are here so that a change to Mexican Spanish can
# be told from an accident,which is the only check it will ever
# have besides an ear.
#
# Written by test/matrix.sh record. One line a case:
# the category, which case in it, the first sixteen hex of
# the samples' hash, the same of the reported answers', and
# the sentence.

plain 1 0ba775696c275992 0b0ba754c9d9821a Hola. Aqui habla el sintetizador de voz Eloquence.
plain 2 99cfd21fd886c40e 4363c88642073554 El doctor Gomez pago 1.234,56 euros el 3 de mayo de 2026 a las 19:45.
plain 3 48ef3e35a65424d1 c72822f6c5c94717 El rapido zorro marron salta sobre el perro perezoso; p.ej. www.ejemplo.es/ruta?q=1
plain 4 630667d03d44fd08 683eca66c396df3f Prueba 1 2 3, ABC XYZ, palabras-con-guion y MAYUSCULAS.
plain 5 4ce382c2a806200e fa26d2bd777d2c76 Una sola palabra. Y otra mas; con "texto citado" en medio.
plain 6 061666f081c8a589 8613a32016d19982 Otorrinolaringologo, desoxirribonucleico, 42% de 3,14159, y el senor Perez-Lopez hijo.
plain 7 f715ce30d77c0cc9 15c0144bb2fdc9c5 Dijo: no lo hagas! Luego (entre parentesis) 1/2 + 3/4 = 5/4; vease p. 12.
